Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.86,Short,,0,0,0,,Your cat sleeps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:02.54,Short,,0,0,0,,up to sixteen hours a day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.02,Short,,0,0,0,,and it's not being lazy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.19,Short,,0,0,0,,Cats are ambush hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:07.02,Short,,0,0,0,,They don't chase prey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:07.86,Short,,0,0,0,,for miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:08.82,Short,,0,0,0,,They wait
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.29,Short,,0,0,0,,then explode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:10.40,Short,,0,0,0,,into a few seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.80,Short,,0,0,0,,of full-speed sprinting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.52,Short,,0,0,0,,and that burns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:13.83,Short,,0,0,0,,a lot of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:14.30,Short,,0,0,0,,So they nap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:15.36,Short,,0,0,0,,to save it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.00,Short,,0,0,0,,They're not really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.38,Short,,0,0,0,,night animals, either
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:18.02,Short,,0,0,0,,They're built
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.32,Short,,0,0,0,,for dawn and dusk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:19.92,Short,,0,0,0,,when mice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:21.12,Short,,0,0,0,,are most active
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:22.40,Short,,0,0,0,,That's why your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.28,Short,,0,0,0,,gets the zoomies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.60,Short,,0,0,0,,right before sunrise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:25.84,Short,,0,0,0,,Most of that sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:27.69,Short,,0,0,0,,is light dozing, too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:28.88,Short,,0,0,0,,The ears keep turning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.22,Short,,0,0,0,,toward every sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:31.18,Short,,0,0,0,,ready to go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:31.84,Short,,0,0,0,,So if your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.84,Short,,0,0,0,,is asleep on your bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:33.56,Short,,0,0,0,,right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.15,Short,,0,0,0,,don't wake it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:34.40,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.95,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho sleeps like a cat
